Advanced materials, manufacture, repair and service (@pe-material-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH", #source "../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30", #source "../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP", #source "../sources/Improving-Motor-and-Drive-System-Performance-DOE.lingua#r_71MGTGWBE9B62SJ1GS6Y3W8MKR", #electrical-power-engineering "../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3") { r_0TMZ0DEYD0E231H94Q90CWNR38
**Read:** [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH), entire relevant design/loss/winding development; [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30), complete applicable construction/design material; [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP), both complete studies and full authorized practice method; [Improving Motor and Drive System Performance — DOE](../sources/Improving-Motor-and-Drive-System-Performance-DOE.lingua#r_71MGTGWBE9B62SJ1GS6Y3W8MKR), whole useful-service and repair/selection context.

Choose a winding/core, transformer, cable or converter component with a defined electrical function and service duty. Read the complete relevant machine/design and repair methods, then follow material origin/processing through [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../../../materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1), [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618) and [Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery](../../../materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D) using the already developed generic production knowledge.

Derive the electrical/field, thermal and mechanical-interface properties needed for the component. Compare composition/microstructure, conductor geometry, insulation, processing, assembly and measured condition rather than treating a material name as a complete specification. Identify how manufacturing/repair variation changes resistance, magnetic loss, dielectric response, geometry or heat flow.

Use suitable supervised fabrication/testing or a fully documented primary case. Predict an independent changed condition and compare evidence before/after a repair or material replacement. Include compatibility, storage, skills/tools, calibration and the actual as-built/as-left state. Finish with a defended functional claim and its operating/maintenance limits, making clear what evidence supports construction and what remains a model. The purpose is to join advanced electrical reasoning to the physical production and continuing work needed to sustain the device.

**Continue:** [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
